SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] NLRB Login.gov Connected Services
DESCRIPTION:Securely access participating NLRB services without needing to
  sign in again during your session.\nLogin.gov is a safe way to sign in to
  many U.S. government websites using just one account. It helps protect yo
 ur information by asking you to take extra steps to make sure it’s reall
 y you when you log in. To protect NLRB user information\, sessions automat
 ically expire after 15 minutes of inactivity.\nSign in with\nLogin.gov\nMy
 NLRB\nCreate a dashboard to follow cases\, save searches\, and view news a
 nd updates from selected regional offices.\nE-Filing Case Documents\nSubmi
 t a new charge or petition electronically through NLRB's secure filing sys
 tem.\nE-Filing Charge/Petition\nFiling a Charge or Petition using the NLRB
 ’s electronic filing (E-File) application.\nMy Account Portal\nView case
 s to which you are a party\, e-file documents to your cases\, view your e-
 file history and manage your profile.\nFrequently Asked Questions\nWhat is
  Login.gov\, and why does the NLRB use it?\nLogin.gov is a secure sign-in 
 service used by participating U.S. government agencies. It allows you to u
 se one Login.gov account to access supported government services.\nThe NLR
 B uses Login.gov to provide secure access to participating NLRB online ser
 vices. Login.gov manages your sign-in credentials\, while the NLRB manages
  the case information\, filings\, profile information\, and other services
  available within NLRB applications.\nLearn more about Login.gov\nWhich NL
 RB services can I access with Login.gov?\nYou can use Login.gov to access 
 NLRB online services that participate in Login.gov. Review the service car
 ds on this page to see which services currently support this sign-in optio
 n.\nAvailable services may include MyNLRB\, electronic filing services\, a
 nd other applications identified on this page. Each service card explains 
 what the service does and provides a link to open it.\nCan I use the same 
 Login.gov account for multiple NLRB services?\nYou can use the same Login.
 gov account to sign in to participating NLRB servic\nhttps://www.nlrb.gov/
 nlrb_services
URL:https://www.nlrb.gov/nlrb_services
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
